IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg5-s243-s245-capital-and-restatement`

-- Tests of dg5-s243-s245-capital-and-restatement.l4 (8 Del. C. ss 243, 244, 245).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text (src:1034-1054 of de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt), beside the assertion.

§ `Section 243 -- retirement of stock`

#ASSERT `s 243(a) the corporation may retire the shares` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 243(a) the corporation may retire the shares` FALSE TRUE)
-- Outstanding shares cannot be retired by resolution: only shares "issued but not outstanding".
#ASSERT NOT (`s 243(a) the corporation may retire the shares` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 243(b) the status of the retired shares` FALSE EQUALS `they resume the status of authorized and unissued shares of the class or series to which they belong`
#ASSERT `s 243(b) the status of the retired shares` TRUE EQUALS `their status is what the certificate of incorporation provides`
#ASSERT `s 243(b) a certificate stating that reissuance of the shares is prohibited must be filed` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 243(b) a certificate stating that reissuance of the shares is prohibited must be filed` FALSE)
-- 300 of 1,000 authorized shares retired with reissuance prohibited: 700 remain authorized.
#ASSERT `s 243(b) the number of authorized shares of the class or series after the certificate becomes effective` 1000 300 EQUALS JUST 700
#ASSERT `s 243(b) the number of authorized shares of the class or series after the certificate becomes effective` 1000 1000 EQUALS JUST 0
-- More retired than authorized, or a negative number: cannot be.
#ASSERT `s 243(b) the number of authorized shares of the class or series after the certificate becomes effective` 1000 1001 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 243(b) the number of authorized shares of the class or series after the certificate becomes effective` 1000 (0 MINUS 1) EQUALS NOTHING
-- All the authorized shares retired: all reference to the class or series is eliminated.
#ASSERT `s 243(b) all reference to the class or series is eliminated from the certificate` 1000 1000
#ASSERT NOT (`s 243(b) all reference to the class or series is eliminated from the certificate` 1000 999)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 243(b) all reference to the class or series is eliminated from the certificate` 0 0)
#ASSERT `s 243(c) the reduction of capital must be effected pursuant to s 244` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 243(c) the reduction of capital must be effected pursuant to s 244` FALSE)

§ `Section 244 -- reduction of capital`

-- helper arguments, in order: the way, the board resolved, the amount to reduce, capital of retired shares, capital of shares purchased/redeemed/converted/exchanged,
-- unallocated capital, par value or stated capital of the new shares, capital of issued par value shares, aggregate par value of them, capital of issued no-par shares.
GIVEN w IS A `dg5 s 244(a) Way of reducing capital`
      rs IS A BOOLEAN
      am IS A NUMBER
      ret IS A NUMBER
      app IS A NUMBER
      un IS A NUMBER
      np IS A NUMBER
      pc IS A NUMBER
      ap IS A NUMBER
      nc IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `dg5 s 244(a) Proposed reduction of capital`
`dg5 test reduction` w rs am ret app un np pc ap nc MEANS
    `dg5 s 244(a) Proposed reduction of capital` WITH
          `the way the capital is to be reduced` IS w
        , `the board of directors adopted a resolution to reduce the capital` IS rs
        , `the amount of capital to be reduced` IS am
        , `the capital represented by the retired shares` IS ret
        , `the capital represented by the shares being purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged` IS app
        , `the capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of capital stock` IS un
        , `the total aggregate par value or stated capital of the previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` IS np
        , `the capital represented by the issued shares of par value capital stock` IS pc
        , `the aggregate par value of those shares` IS ap
        , `the capital represented by the issued shares of capital stock without par value` IS nc

-- (a)(1): all the capital of the retired shares (1,000), no more.
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired` TRUE 1000 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired` TRUE 1001 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0))
-- Only by resolution of the board of directors.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired` FALSE 1000 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired` TRUE (0 MINUS 5) 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0))
-- (a)(2): the capital of the shares purchased or redeemed (500) plus unallocated capital (200) = 700.
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by applying to an otherwise authorized purchase or redemption of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being purchased or redeemed, or any capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 700 0 500 200 0 0 0 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by applying to an otherwise authorized purchase or redemption of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being purchased or redeemed, or any capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 701 0 500 200 0 0 0 0))
-- (a)(3): conversion or exchange: 500 + 200 = 700 applied, less 300 par or stated capital of the new shares = 400 released.
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital not allocated to a class, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` TRUE 400 0 500 200 300 0 0 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital not allocated to a class, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` TRUE 401 0 500 200 300 0 0 0))
-- ... if the new shares' par value exceeds the capital applied, nothing is released.
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital not allocated to a class, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` TRUE 0 0 500 200 800 0 0 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital not allocated to a class, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` TRUE 1 0 500 200 800 0 0 0))
-- (a)(4)(i): capital not represented by any particular class (200).
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 200 0 0 200 0 0 0 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 201 0 0 200 0 0 0 0))
-- (a)(4)(ii): issued par value shares: capital 900 in excess of the aggregate par value 600 = 300.
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital represented by issued shares of its par value capital stock, which capital is in excess of the aggregate par value of such shares` TRUE 300 0 0 0 0 900 600 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital represented by issued shares of its par value capital stock, which capital is in excess of the aggregate par value of such shares` TRUE 301 0 0 0 0 900 600 0))
-- (a)(4)(iii): "some of" the capital of issued no-par shares (1,000): part, not all (Fork F10).
#ASSERT `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some of the capital represented by issued shares of its capital stock without par value` TRUE 999 0 0 0 0 0 0 1000)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some of the capital represented by issued shares of its capital stock without par value` TRUE 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0 1000))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some of the capital represented by issued shares of its capital stock without par value` TRUE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 1000))
-- Subsection (b): the assets remaining must be sufficient to pay the debts not otherwise provided for.
#ASSERT `s 244(b) the assets remaining after the reduction are sufficient to pay the debts` 100 100
#ASSERT `s 244(b) the assets remaining after the reduction are sufficient to pay the debts` 101 100
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244(b) the assets remaining after the reduction are sufficient to pay the debts` 99 100)
#ASSERT `s 244 the corporation may reduce its capital` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 200 0 0 200 0 0 0 0) 500 500
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244 the corporation may reduce its capital` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 200 0 0 200 0 0 0 0) 499 500)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 244 the corporation may reduce its capital` (`dg5 test reduction` `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock` TRUE 201 0 0 200 0 0 0 0) 500 500)
-- No reduction releases the liability of a stockholder whose shares have not been fully paid.
#ASSERT `s 244(b) the stockholder's liability on the shares not fully paid survives the reduction of capital` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 244(b) the stockholder's liability on the shares not fully paid survives the reduction of capital` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 245 -- restated certificate of incorporation`

#ASSERT `s 245(a) the corporation may adopt the restated certificate of incorporation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(a) the corporation may adopt the restated certificate of incorporation` FALSE)
-- Merely restates: the board without a stockholder vote, or at the directors' choice submitted to the stockholders under section 242.
#ASSERT `s 245(b) how the restated certificate must be adopted` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders`
#ASSERT `s 245(b) how the restated certificate must be adopted` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `proposed by the directors and submitted to the stockholders, with the procedure and vote required, if any, by section 242`
-- Further amends: section 242 once payment has been received, section 241 if not.
#ASSERT `s 245(b) how the restated certificate must be adopted` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `proposed by the directors and adopted by the stockholders in the manner and by the vote prescribed by section 242`
#ASSERT `s 245(b) how the restated certificate must be adopted` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `adopted in the manner and by the vote prescribed by section 241`

-- helper arguments, in order: designated restated, states present name, name changed, states original name, states filing date of the original,
-- states duly adopted, adopted by the board without a vote, states it only restates and there is no discrepancy.
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 245(c) Restated certificate of incorporation`
`dg5 test restated certificate` a b c d e f g h MEANS
    `dg5 s 245(c) Restated certificate of incorporation` WITH
          `it is specifically designated as a restated certificate in its heading` IS a
        , `it states the corporation's present name in its heading or in an introductory paragraph` IS b
        , `the corporation's name has been changed since it was originally incorporated` IS c
        , `it states the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated` IS d
        , `it states the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation with the Secretary of State` IS e
        , `it states that it was duly adopted in accordance with section 245` IS f
        , `it was adopted by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders, other than under section 241 or without a vote of members under section 242(b)(3)` IS g
        , `it states that it only restates and integrates and does not further amend the provisions as theretofore amended or supplemented, and that there is no discrepancy between those provisions and the provisions of the restated certificate` IS h

#ASSERT `s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- If the name was changed, the original name must be stated.
#ASSERT `s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- Adopted by the board without a vote: it must also say it only restates and integrates and that there is no discrepancy.
#ASSERT `s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` (`dg5 test restated certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- Omissions.
#ASSERT `s 245(c) the omission is deemed not to be a further amendment` `provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 245(c) the omission is deemed not to be a further amendment` `provisions contained in an amendment as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 245(c) the omission is deemed not to be a further amendment` `any other provision than the two that section 245(c) lets a restated certificate omit` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Subsection (d) and (e).
#ASSERT `s 245(d) the restated certificate supersedes the original certificate of incorporation as theretofore amended or supplemented` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(d) the restated certificate supersedes the original certificate of incorporation as theretofore amended or supplemented` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 245(d) the date of incorporation after the restated certificate is filed` (YMD 2019 4 2) EQUALS YMD 2019 4 2
#ASSERT `s 245(e) the amendment or change in the restatement is subject to the provision` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(e) the amendment or change in the restatement is subject to the provision` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 245(e) the amendment or change in the restatement is subject to the provision` FALSE FALSE)
